      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, it\u0027s preferable to change the opcode value, but CrOS has a unique problem where we dual source the BT controller for the same board/model. So for the \"brya\" board we actually could have an Intel or Mediatek BT controller. Right now, we don\u0027t have a good way to distinguish them (being worked on in b/385857456), so this is our workaround until we can. \n\nMediatek controllers support APCF, so besides this initial start up, they won\u0027t be using MSFT code.",
